@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：買家實體書櫃取書與撥款

actor 買家 as Buyer
actor 賣家 as Seller
participant "PickupBookScreen" as ScanUI
participant "OrderDetailScreen" as OrderUI
participant "ApiService(OrdersApi)" as ApiSvc
participant "PATCH /api/orders/:id/status" as Route
participant "orders/index.js" as OrdersSvc
participant "orders/settlement.js" as Settlement
participant "wallet.js" as WalletSvc
database "Prisma / MariaDB" as DB

Buyer -> ScanUI : 開啟「取書」掃描櫃上QR Code
ScanUI -> ScanUI : 相機掃描並比對\npending_pickup訂單清單
ScanUI -> OrderUI : 導向對應訂單詳情
Buyer -> OrderUI : 取出實體書後點擊「我已取貨」
OrderUI -> OrderUI : showConfirmDialog(確認取貨)
OrderUI -> ApiSvc : updateOrderStatus(orderId, 'completed')
ApiSvc -> Route : PATCH /api/orders/:id/status
Route -> OrdersSvc : advance(orderId, user, 'completed')
OrdersSvc -> OrdersSvc : 檢查操作者為訂單買家(或admin)
OrdersSvc -> OrdersSvc : 檢查 order.status ∈\n['deposited','pending_pickup']
alt 狀態不符
  OrdersSvc --> OrderUI : 400「賣家尚未存書，無法完成取書」
else 狀態符合
  OrdersSvc -> Settlement : transition(tx, order, 'completed')
  Settlement -> DB : guardedUpdate(status='completed',\npicked_up_at, completed_at)
  Settlement -> Settlement : phaseOf('completed') == 'paid_out'
  Settlement -> DB : ledgerOf(tx, order)\n（依wallet_transactions帳本實算已入帳金額）
  Settlement -> Settlement : due = total_amount - sellerReceived
  alt due > 0
    Settlement -> WalletSvc : changeBalance(seller, +due, 'sale_income')
    WalletSvc -> DB : wallets.update(balance +=due,\ntotal_income += due)
    WalletSvc -> DB : wallet_transactions.create()
  end
  Settlement -> DB : tx.books.updateMany(status='sold'\nwhere status='reserved')
  Settlement --> OrdersSvc : 完成
  OrdersSvc -> DB : notify 賣家「買家已取書，\nX代幣已撥入您的錢包」
  OrdersSvc --> OrderUI : 200 OK
  OrderUI -> OrderUI : 導向 PickupSuccessScreen
  DB --> Seller : 推播通知
end
@enduml
